{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5c26fe698e7f02b7d97e7e6a271910d47d9e52d35523bd5fd356b36176fca085", "ja": "（新しい衣装が完成したので、\n早速朋花に試着してもらっている……）", "zh": "（新服装已经完成了，所以现在正让朋花试穿……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "1cb5be5160b9e1c5b9514fbd414393f00d601148c04dfe5bf6ccb500dadbb214", "ja": "ふむふむ～……？　{$P$}さん、\nそれではまず、説明していただけますか～？", "zh": "嗯嗯～……？{$P$}先生，\n那么首先，可以请您说明一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a5626b9127506ea4d3d03540d5197c3a9343255603ffc71d5e611978ba53dbd5", "ja": "えっ、説明って？　なんの……？", "zh": "诶，说明？说明什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "9a71898ff4547ab8eb7e381cc8c55d907fd83b17d1cf90200088ee0d7418d25b", "ja": "もちろん、この衣装についてですよ～。\nどういうつもりで、このデザインにしたんですか～？", "zh": "当然是关于这套服装的啦～。\n您究竟是出于什么考虑，才设计成这样的呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "84fca5433c982a88c995b9ae0cdd3ae29686008a13934ed49938be865a71e52a", "ja": "私に何を求めているのか、\n目指すところを、先に聞いておきたいと思いまして～。", "zh": "我想先问问，您希望我做到什么，以及想要达到怎样的目标～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1005_p", "source_sha256": "624d8cb5d4031994180d42a7be9a7baa9dcad9c1d4b51689c28154b52550e619", "ja": "なるほど……その衣装は、王道的なアイドルの可愛さを\n引き立てるようなデザインにしてもらったつもりだよ。", "zh": "原来如此……我本来是想让这套服装采用能够衬托出经典偶像可爱感的设计。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "4130502e206327589697ec28f6b209edc47824e338c6eba3fffddeedc7c580c3", "ja": "王道ですか～？　でも見たところ、\n無機質でダークな雰囲気が強い気がしますけど～？", "zh": "是王道吗～？不过在我看来，感觉更偏向冷硬又阴暗的风格呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2803c7327245e117e40356c5c838fbef417d66037590f7ab95af1da8a21d2180", "ja": "それはそうだな。朋花はその衣装で、\nいつもより可愛さをアピールして欲しいんだ。", "zh": "确实如此。我希望朋花穿上那套服装，展现出比平时更加可爱的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6f17f0670716c4e62233c9c44220e8d45379c6dcb9cf4efd4b4d48eccdbe34ef", "ja": "ギャップのある衣装で、可愛さを引き立てる狙いだよ。\nそういうところ、ファンも見たいと思うから。", "zh": "是想通过反差感十足的服装来衬托可爱之处。\n因为我觉得粉丝们也想看到这样的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "ea4bb788435283f22aa66b18895c57296ee477c178aae19690ddf646cf8a07c5", "ja": "なるほど、子豚ちゃんたちのニーズも\n考えてのことでしたか～。なかなかやりますね～♪", "zh": "原来如此，是考虑到了小猪们的需求啊～。真是有一手呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "479cddaf7a0d3e42f25f8715cdb68f171eb2e3d31462428fcda5e21441926ce0", "ja": "そういうことであれば、納得しましたよ～。\nでも、可愛さをアピールですか……。", "zh": "这样的话，我就明白了哦～  \n不过，要展现可爱吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "1237c350af6b1ae5b8368dacee9a4f5961231815502ed4683f42cd000626d687", "ja": "あまりそういうアピールは、したことがないので……。\n練習しなくてはいけませんね～。", "zh": "我不太擅长那样展现自己，所以……\n看来得练习一下了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d222eb49c4fd4ee14cd602e0b40b6b47e7b56db595a0782fd1a6a1f717b427c9", "ja": "まあ、劇場にはそういうのが得意な子もいるから。\n観察してみたらどうだろう？", "zh": "不过，剧场里也有擅长这个的孩子。\n试着观察看看怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "02f0940416e5cb67ae805650b4d44c3fc2b2cbe907b1ea6846186cd9ef3db23c", "ja": "……。{$P$}さん？\n他の子と私を比べるなんて、生意気ですよ～？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生？\n居然拿我和其他孩子比较，真是太放肆了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ea788ef2f9360442e455a6447f3e0224782db71739fab93961c185ab6ff85370", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、そんなつもりは……！\nお手本にしたらどうかなって思っただけだよ。", "zh": "诶！？不，我没那个意思……！\n只是觉得，要不要拿来当作参考呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "08fe4e102fa9c869951fac0ca3fb1ae218610dd9b3e757006f38f19822b01557", "ja": "うふふ……まあ、いいでしょう～。\n確かに、お手本になりそうな人はいますからね～。", "zh": "呵呵……好吧～。\n确实，身边也是有能作为榜样的人呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "62316b999c653ab2825c4cf39ce08fd72038197c98ee9ae4c13ffc304cb5bf88", "ja": "練習して、{$P$}さんも知らない、\n新しい聖母の姿を見せて差し上げましょう～♪", "zh": "好好练习，然后向{$P$}先生展示一个连您都不曾见过的、新的圣母姿态吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a68fa046c31a39bd5df1351d628feaa1c6dcf03d4af503842a20f9414cd93dff", "ja": "あ、ああ、宜しく頼んだぞ！", "zh": "啊、啊啊，就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "596fa860b4308961289a883ff44a66dd4d2837cfccdadf63bc38a48b75d747c4", "ja": "他人事みたいに言いますね～？\n{$P$}さんも、頑張るんですよ～？", "zh": "您说得就像事不关己一样呢～？\n{$P$}先生也要加油哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "a16248e30a6037a82c63d41e4099df242a490c4fc21ea60f80cd4422506597bf", "ja": "新たな聖母に相応しい、\n最高の舞台を、用意してくださいね～？", "zh": "请为配得上新圣母的她，准备好最棒的舞台哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_031tom0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_031tom0384_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "7588bb3f17b40d389663a6dd1e60019fc8ecd3f1ca1ce2302181e2d8214fdcb9", "ja": "できなければ……うふふ♪\n「ぜーったい、許さないんだからぁ～っ☆」！", "zh": "要是做不到的话……呵呵♪「我绝对不会原谅你的哦～☆」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
